<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>气色 - 标签 | 观颐斋</title><link>https://lruihao.cn/tags/%E6%B0%94%E8%89%B2/</link><description>这里不仅是我研习中医经典的私人书斋，更是一处致力于 “观照经典以明医理，颐养身心以扶正气” 的清净之地。</description><generator>Hugo 0.161.0 &amp; FixIt v1.0.0-alpha-mt895zhg</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</webMaster><copyright>本站内容采用 CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 国际许可协议。</copyright><lastBuildDate>Wed, 24 Jun 2026 13:45:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://lruihao.cn/tags/%E6%B0%94%E8%89%B2/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>六论气色</title><link>https://lruihao.cn/posts/5-19-lunqise/</link><pubDate>Wed, 24 Jun 2026 13:40:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</author><guid>https://lruihao.cn/posts/5-19-lunqise/</guid><category domain="https://lruihao.cn/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%BA%94%E4%B9%A6%E9%9B%86/">卷五书集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》附篇“六论气色”，由&lt;strong&gt;雷公真君&lt;/strong&gt;论述面部望诊的部位划分、五色主病、生克预后及察神辨色之法。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;察面分部位以候脏腑，观五色以辨病邪，审浮沉枯润以知深浅生死，尤以辨神为要——色暗有神者虽重可生，色明无神者虽无病亦危&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item></channel></rss>